  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Gen III Level 3 ECWCS Fleece Jackets are built to work with the Extreme Cold Weather Clothing System. Get ready to battle the cold with these high-quality fleece jackets. They&rsquo;re great for military personnel, along with outdoor enthusiasts, and those that enjoy hiking, camping, skiing, off-roading, and other activities out in the wilderness.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "9259",
  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Gen III Level 3 ECWCS Fleece Jackets are built to work with the Extreme Cold Weather Clothing System. Get ready to battle the cold with these high-quality fleece jackets. They&rsquo;re great for military personnel, along with outdoor enthusiasts, and those that enjoy hiking, camping, skiing, off-roading, and other activities out in the wilderness. Combat the Cold: Our Gen III Level 3 ECWCS Fleece Jackets are built to work with the Extreme Cold Weather Clothing System, and will keep your body warm and comfortable in a variety of environments. These ruggedly reliable jackets are great for military personnel and outdoor enthusiasts. Rugged Material Construction: Made of super soft and warm polar fleece fabric, these outdoor military jackets effortlessly retain body heat. The full front zipper extends through the collar to form a turtleneck-like design, giving you additional coverage and protection around the neck. The reinforced nylon patches at the neck, shoulders, and elbows provide structure, durability, and unparalleled warmth. Breathable Side Panels: These tactical jackets feature gridded side and armpit panels for better breathability so that you don&rsquo;t overheat. Don&rsquo;t worry about working up a sweat while strapped up; the gridded panels will help alleviate the excess heat. Go ahead and take that wintery jog, chop away at those wood logs, or shovel until snow&rsquo;s out of the way. Versatile Layering: Along with aiding you against cold, harsh environments, these 100% polar fleece jackets can be worn as a standalone jacket (perfect for fall and spring), or as a liner for a soft shell military jacket, parka, or other combat ready outerwear. Utility at the Forefront: Each stretch-grid fleece jacket features 2 lined hand pockets for comfort, and 2 interior mesh pockets for added storage capabilities. Furthermore, the elastic cuffs seal in warmth while keeping the wind out. There are also incorporated loop fields on both sides for name and military rank badges.</p>",
